{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/Overview.png?t=1741540839\" />Traverse a massive interconnected world on the sand-swept planet of Protea VI. Unveil the grim mysteries of Protea VI at your own pace as Moadra. Endure challenging combat and evolve Moadra's abilities, solve puzzles, and reveal countless hidden paths and secrets throughout your mission to uncover your lost Neera heritage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/BannerText1.png?t=1741540839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/MoadraExploring.gif?t=1741540839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are trying to endure the desolate surface, ascend the deadly, freezing summits, or scout the research facility infested with malicious alien species, Protea VI has many lost secrets to uncover after your ancestor's extinction 20,000 years ago. Dangers await around every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/BannerText2.png?t=1741540839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/MoadraSurviving.gif?t=1741540839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Moadra\u2019s agility to your advantage to roll, dodge, leap, wall jump, and sprint at never-before-seen speeds to evade deadly organisms and hazardous elements. Use your swift reflexes, an arsenal of weapons, and special abilities to survive everything from low-level threats to gargantuan monsters that force you to use every tool at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/BannerText3.png?t=1741540839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/MoadraScanning.gif?t=1741540839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate your scanner bot and use X-ray vision to examine creatures and your surroundings more closely. Reveal hidden paths and secret areas invisible to the naked eye, and map out the places you explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blow up unfriendly creatures and organisms to absorb their Protoplasm, lumps of energy-packed biomass. Consume it inside organic chambers to apply metamorphosis, and evolve your abilities and weapons to new levels.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1713730?t=1741540839","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1713730?t=1741540839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/97e215c4e224faaa79e937fb01262551513ececc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741540839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/97e215c4e224faaa79e937fb01262551513ececc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741540839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Moadra contains frequent violence and gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3499730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/extras/Overview.png?t=1741540839\" />Traverse a massive interconnected world on the sand-swept planet of Protea VI. Unveil the grim mysteries of Protea VI at y