 scanner bot and use X-ray vision to examine creatures and your surroundings more closely. Reveal hidden paths and secret areas invisible to the naked eye, and map out the places you explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blow up unfriendly creatures and organisms to absorb their Protoplasm, lumps of energy-packed biomass. Consume it inside organic chambers to apply metamorphosis, and evolve your abilities and weapons to new levels.  </p>","developers":["Gloomsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713730/header.jpg?t=1741540839","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Gloomsoft Oy. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099737,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099737/movie480.mp4?t=1739896633","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099737/movie_max.mp4?t=1739896633"},"name":"Moadra Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099737/f75df87f9f4601868706b79a16d654deedff19b8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739896633","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099737/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739896633","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099737/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739896633"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256856205,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256856205/movie480.mp4?t=1652455761","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256856205/movie_max.mp4?t=1652455761"},"name":"Moa